---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import StickyBar from '../components/StickyBar.astro';
---
<Layout>
  <Header />
  <div class="pt-24 pb-16 bg-gray-50 min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 bg-white p-8 md:p-12 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-6">Terms & Conditions</h1>
      
      <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        <p>By booking a service with Arushi RO Service, you agree to the following terms and conditions.</p>
        
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-2">1. Service Calls</h2>
        <p>Our technicians will visit your premises at the scheduled time. Please ensure someone is available to provide access to the RO system.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-2">2. Charges & Payments</h2>
        <p>A standard visiting/inspection fee may apply. Replacement parts will be charged separately. We will provide a transparent quotation before starting any repair work. Payments can be made via Cash, UPI, or Online transfer.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-2">3. Parts & Warranty</h2>
        <p>We use 100% genuine spare parts. A limited warranty of 30 days is provided on our repair work, and standard manufacturer warranty applies to replaced parts.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-2">4. Cancellations</h2>
        <p>You may reschedule or cancel your booking by calling us at +91 9873881738 at least 2 hours prior to the scheduled time.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <Footer />
  <StickyBar />
</Layout>